          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘસડવું — ghasaḍvũ — \"to drag\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તે ભારે પટારો રસ્તા પર ઘસડે છે. te bhāre paṭāro rastā par ghasḍe che. He drags the heavy trunk along the road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે પટારો ઘસડ્યો, teṇe paṭāro ghasaḍyo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘસડવું (ghasaḍvũ) seems to be built on the root of the Gujarati verb ghasvũ, \"to rub\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit gharṣati, \"rubs\" (CDIAL 4450): what you drag rubs along the ground. CDIAL gives no form for ઘસડવું itself, so the link is hedged."
            }
          ]
        },
